{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/663284-share-your-stories-of-epicness-failure-and-what","id":663284,"title":"Share your stories of Epicness, failure and \"What?\"","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-13T11:10:23-07:00","id":663284,"title":"Share your stories of Epicness, failure and \"What?\"","content":"every game has some bizarre moments and elements.<br /> From the infamous malkavian with a magic chicken suit (which allowed him to casts fireballs), to the time one of my player's was plumming to malfeas in a nephandi ship and he seduced It...and it worked...<br /> <br /> tell your bizarre, epic, funny and weird moments from your games and campaings","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-13T12:28:43-07:00","id":663383,"title":"","content":"The Malkavian scion of a Louhi's line and her Brujah 'protector' had broken into the home of a freaky local doctor. In the doctor's basement they found evidence of bizarre experiments, apparently meant to reanimate stitched-together corpses via some form of alchemy. Use of mystical arts led the pair to a hallway that ended abruptly with a blank wall, at which point the Voice-in-the-Malkavian's-Head piped up...<br /> <br /> Voice: The remnants of the failed are behind that wall.<br /> <br /> Malkavian: What? Like ghosts?<br /> <br /> Voice: Like ghosts... Suffering.<br /> <br /> Malkavian: Are they trapped?<br /> <br /> Voice: Imprisoned.<br /> <br /> Malkavian: Do they want out?<br /> <br /> Voice: Oh, they do want out... They suffer in their prison.<br /> <br /> Malkavian: We need to break down this wall!<br /> <br /> ...After the Brujah destroys the wall with her bare hands, after the 'ghosts' escape, after the wave of psychic dissonance caused by the escape of these wretched and malevolent beings crests and ebbs (leaving the Malkavian knocked on her arse with the worst Auspex-induced headache ever)...<br /> <br /> Brujah: What the hell happened?<br /> <br /> Malkavian: I \u2013 I dunno. They were suffering... They wanted out...<br /> <br /> Voice: I didn't say you SHOULD let them out!<br /> <br /> <b>Note</b>: This was a good year BEFORE I saw the film <i>The Ring</i>, and needless to say my troupe was floored by a very similar exchange... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>B.I.G. Bird spreads the word: Anybody with a heart votes love<br /> <a href=\"https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/</a></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/409-phaolan","name":"Phaolan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar409_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"478"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T15:11:14-07:00","id":668866,"title":"","content":"This was more of a funny moment where my Dark Ages Brujah came to a silly belief. Marie was a teenage peasant girl who lived in the boonies in central France so she wouldn't even know about dark-skinned people. After exploring a temple in Rome, the catorie came across a pair of dark-skinned Seties who were awakening and breaking out from these statues they were hiding in. So after hearing about some Arab (Setie-aligned) traders they were traveling with were known from their stone work, she now believes that all black and Arab people hatch out of rocks. The ST said he could see where Marie would get that conclusion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my DriveThruRPG books at: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Carrie%20Kube\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....=Carrie%20Kube</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1834-yaoi-huntress-earth","name":"Yaoi Huntress Earth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T18:02:53-07:00","id":670351,"title":"","content":"Had a gangrel once who tried to light the fire dance with molotov cocktail only to horribly botch the roll and set the arch bishop on fire....oops","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-19T02:53:33-07:00","id":670651,"title":"","content":"In my current group, the Ventrue butcherd the oldest ghoul from his mentor because the group wanted to steal something from said Mentor. That derailed the plot a little bit. <br /> <br /> The player is new in the role playing business so while he does some awesome character playing, he is a little with over his head with the hole clans and politics in the Cam. So I kinda punished and rewarded him at the same time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5970-meldok","name":"Meldok","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"221"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-19T09:25:17-07:00","id":671021,"title":"","content":"So this happened a long, long time ago. A friend of mine picked up the Streetfighter RPG for fun and my group decided to make characters and play a one shot. <br /> <br /> I didn't have much inspiration so I decided to make Zangief's younger brother, who was basically just like Zangief. Huge, muscle-y and intimidating. And I ended up having a blast during character creation, talking in a terrible Russian accent the whole time.<br /> <br /> The ST decided to have the game start off on a dramatic moment, so he tells the group that my Zangief character finds his character standing in an alleyway surrounded by several thugs. <br /> <br /> ST: &quot;One of the thugs waves a gun at you. 'Why don't you gimmie your wallet there big guy or else,' he says as his friends look on.&quot;<br /> <br /> Me: (In my terrible Russian accent) - &quot;Hahaha, tiny man. Your little gun will not be able to touch these muscles! Why do you not go ahead and try take your best shot? &quot; And then my character struck a pose. <br /> <br /> ST: &quot;So I guess you let him shoot you to prove how tough you are? Alright... *rolls dice*<br /> <br /> He rolled 7 dice and every die came up a 10. He pauses, looks at his character sheet and says ,&quot;Oh, he has a specialty in guns so he gets to reroll those.&quot; 3 three more dice come up as 10s. &quot;Oh, and bonus successes carry over to damage... plus the gun's damage so...&quot;<br /> <br /> When he went to roll damage they were all successes. My character got shot in the head and was killed 30 seconds into the game. <br /> <br /> Everyone else at the table instantly busted up laughing and sat there howling while I just had to sit there with a sheepish look on my face.<br /> <br /> &quot;Why do you not go ahead and try take your best shot?&quot; has turned into something of a running joke in my group since then.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-19T18:33:55-07:00","id":671581,"title":"","content":"That wasn't relevant to cWoD, but it was damn hilarious!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}